## Sparse Matching

Not all occurrences are matchable from all critiques. The `matchable_occurrences()` function returns which GT occurrences a critique can reach:

```sql
SELECT * FROM matchable_occurrences('snapshot/slug', ARRAY['src/foo.py', 'src/bar.py']);
```

- `match_filter_hash IS NULL`: No file restriction - matchable from any files
- `match_filter_hash IS NOT NULL`: File-scoped - only matchable when critique touches overlapping files
